# Packs (project layer of the stack)

Engine is generic; packs hold URLs, accounts (env names), allowlists, actions, helpers, facts, evals.

```text
packs/<slug>/{pack.yaml,facts.md,helpers/*.py,evals/}
```

## pack.yaml ↔ runtime

| Key | Stack effect |
|---|---|
| `redmine.project_ids` | Selects pack after Redmine fetch |
| `apps.*.envs` | Run URLs; browser site limit derived from these |
| `apps.*.accounts.password_env` | Secret name in `.env` only |
| `manual_login_apps` | Headed CAPTCHA login before cases |
| `allowlist` | Known hosts (no plan-gate nag); not a security boundary |
| `preapprovable_actions` / `always_ask_actions` / `risky_patterns` | `tools/policy.py` |
| `helpers.<name>` | Enables MCP helper when `needs_config` filled from live UI |

Validate: `.venv/bin/python -m agent_tester pack validate <slug>`

## Helpers (Playwright MCP adapter)

- `HELPER` dict + `async run(browser, ctx, **params)` → `{values, screenshots, notes}`
- Use `McpBrowser` labels/refs; no CSS, no evaluate
- Disabled until live path/labels set — never guess (Savostore helpers still empty)
- Priority: CRM status/parcel helpers + open-by-number (`A1148` vs `1148`)

No secrets in yaml/facts/evals. Wiki → addresses only.
